Package: deb-progress-installer
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, zenity, dpkg, coreutils
Description: Lightweight graphical progress bar wrapper for local deb installations
 A utility that uses Zenity to show a visual progress bar while 
 installing local Debian (.deb) packages, replacing legacy tools 
 like GDebi.
